        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "Auditions in Toronto - 2024-04-28, 15h45 | Le Patin Libre"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#description": [
      {
        "@language": "fr",
        "@value": "For expert skaters only (figure skaters, hockey players, freestylers).\nThe audition is free but upon invitation only.\nTo be invited: send a video (link or file) of your skating at alex@lepatinlibre.com.\nThe audition is a 45 minutes workshop about the basics our choreographic technique."
